            "title": "盤中速報 - 光鼎(6226)股價拉至漲停，漲停價36.3元，成交45,106張",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>光鼎(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6226:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6226\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6226-TW</a>)15日09:23上漲3.3元，股價漲停報36.3元，委買9,877張，成交45,106張。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>主要業務為製造、加工及銷售各種發光二極體、發光二極體顯示器。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>光鼎(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:6226:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/6226\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">6226-TW</a>)近5日股價上漲1.85%，集中市場<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/TWS/TSE01\">加權指數</a>下跌3.09%，股價漲幅表現優於大盤。</p></section><section><p><em>近5日籌碼</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>三大法人合計買賣超：-4,937 張</li> <li>外資買賣超：-4,853 張</li> <li>投信買賣超：-5 張</li> <li>自營商買賣超：-79 張</li> <li>融資增減：+217 張</li> <li>融券增減：+387 張</li> </ul></section></main>",
